        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Ruhanga ow'obusingye, owaagarwire Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo okuruga omu bafu, Omuriisa w'entaama omukuru, ahabw'eshagama y'endagaano etahwaho, ",
          "type": "text",
